          <tr class="capx-group"><th colspan="3" scope="colgroup">Inventory &amp; RFID</th></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Inventory control</th><td>Item-level visibility across stores, warehouses and channels; receiving, transfers and adjustments from the device.</td><td><span class="capx-n">Native</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Counting</th><td>Full-store counts in about 20 minutes and targeted cycle counts, without closing the door.</td><td><span class="capx-n">Native</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">End-to-end RFID</th><td>EPC encoding at receiving, unit control ledger, RFID checkout and self-checkout, EAS loss prevention, no middleware.</td><td><span class="capx-n">Native</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">RFID hardware</th><td>Certified readers, sleds, bins, counter pads and tag printers, including Bluebird RFID handhelds. The full certified list is published separately.</td><td><span class="capx-c">Connected</span></td></tr>

          <tr class="capx-group"><th colspan="3" scope="colgroup">Order management &amp; fulfillment</th></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Order routing</th><td>Order Fill Logic selects the fulfillment location; split shipments and incoming/outgoing queues.</td><td><span class="capx-n">Native</span></td></tr>
